<title>JAPAN: Sankyo Rikagaku -Jun/Mar parent forecast.</title>
<headline>Sankyo Rikagaku -Jun/Mar parent forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ten months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    ACTUAL</p>
<p> (Parent)	     FORECAST	  YEAR-AGO</p>
<p> Sales		 10.05		12.04</p>
<p> Current	    570    million	 618    million</p>
<p> Net		  240    million	 344    million</p>
<p> EPS		   41.25 yen	  63.70 yen</p>
<p> Ord div	     10.00 yen	   9.00 yen</p>
<p> -Commem div	     -		 1.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sankyo Rikagaku Co Ltd specialises in coated</p>
<p>papers and abrasives. The latest forecasts were for the</p>
<p>10-month period ending March 31, 1997, because the company</p>
<p>changed its business term. The year-ago figures were for</p>
<p>the full year to May 31, 1996.</p>
